{"id":"en_thor-thunder-returns","title":"Thor：Thunder Returns","titleEn":"Thor：Thunder Returns","description":"Two decades after the Abyss brought ruin to the world, Mjölnir fell from the sky and gave humanity divine runes, letting them command thunder to protect the mortal realm. Iven was born in that storm, but the rune destined for him was taken by his uncle and given to his cousin. Twenty years on, Iven answers the call of the Trial of Thunder, yet without his rune he is treated as incomplete. His scars are mocked, his claim rejected, while his cousin, who stole his power, is hailed as the rightful heir of thunder and even uses that might to judge Iven and his family. When the Abyss breaks the seal, Iven regains his memories and awakens Thor's true name. Those who worshipped and wielded the thunder then grasp that its authority and protection had always belonged to the man they dismissed as bro","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/thorthunder-returns/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/thorthunder-returns/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Faceslapping","Urban","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7difc4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_thor-thunder-returns_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7difc4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_thor-thunder-returns_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7difc4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_thor-thunder-returns_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7difc4/?pub=4occak","kin